# Bulk without hint: the appended leaf starts at the WAL head at its switch's end
# instead of its birth hint capped at the old leaf's frontier, so a foreign record of
# the range allocated after the narrow and before the switch ends lies below its read
# position. The violation needs no live advance: the hint is the birth read position.
# Moved from the design's ReadPositionHonestBulkWithoutHint.
MODULE: BulkHintBoundWithoutHint
TARGET: BulkHintBound
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the appended leaf starts at the WAL head at its switch's end instead of its capped birth hint
PERTURBS: Finish

--- FIND
    /\ rpN' = IF relocOk /\ hint # Null THEN Min2(hint - 1, fO) ELSE rpN
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the head at the switch's end, not the capped birth hint.
    /\ rpN' = IF relocOk /\ hint # Null THEN next - 1 ELSE rpN
--- END